tract only</td><td>eive placebo. (Funded by the British Heart Foundation and others; Current Controlled Trials number, ISRCTN60635500 ; ClinicalTrials.gov number, NCT00135226 .).</td></tr><tr><td>PMID 20929341</td><td>public/non-profit</td><td>abstract only</td><td>ying therapy. (Funded by the Netherlands Heart Foundation and others; ClinicalTrials.gov number, NCT00127452.).</td></tr><tr><td>PMID 33190147</td><td>not stated (abstract only â€” full text not retrieved)</td><td>abstract only</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>PMID 21115589</td><td>not stated (abstract only â€” full text not retrieved)</td><td>abstract only</td><td></td></tr></table></div>",
