The important wrinkle: many records are legitimate randomized omega-3 trials but only on lipids, vascular function, thrombosis/access, remodeling, or biomarkers. Per the protocol text, I’m treating those as `ELIGIBLE_RCT_NO_PRIMARY` when P/I/C/design are settled, not as exclusions just because MACE is absent.
